<title>CANADA: Sun Ice Ltd 9 mos Aug 31 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Sun Ice Ltd 9 mos Aug 31 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY, Alberta 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr	   Loss	C$0.42     Loss	C$0.45</p>
<p> Net	   Loss	 2,700     Loss	 2,900</p>
<p> Revs			27,000		   29,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Three-month sales were C$12 million versus the prior-year quarter's C$15.4 million. The results for the three months reflect the impact of Sun Ice's efforts to restructure its operations through the sell-off of excess inventories and through reduced deliveries, the company said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
